  "The 5W2H template is a structured format for problem-solving and analysis, focusing on two \"Hows\" (How, How Much) and five \"Whys\" (Why, Who, Where, When, What). \n\nThis template guides a thorough exploration of a situation or problem, facilitating comprehensive understanding and effective decision-making.": "七问分析法（5W2H）从谁、做什么、在哪里、何时、为什么、怎么做、多少这七个角度分析问题。\n\n逐项回答，有助于了解情况、找出遗漏，并为决策提供依据。",
  "This question aims to define the subject, event, or issue being discussed or analyzed.": "明确要讨论或分析的事情、事件或问题。",
