  "Attainable": "可实现",
  "The goal should be relevant to the direction you want your career, business, or project to head. This means that it aligns with other relevant goals and fits into your immediate and long-term plans.": "目标应与职业、业务或项目的发展方向一致，同时符合近期和长期计划。",
  "Relevant": "相关",
  "The goal should have a defined timeline, including a starting date and a target date. The purpose is to create urgency and prompt action.": "为目标设定开始日期和完成期限，以便及时行动。",
