  "A SMART principle template is designed to help in setting effective goals or objectives by ensuring they are Specific, Measurable, Achievable, Relevant, and Time-bound. \n\nThis template typically includes sections or prompts for each of these criteria, guiding you to refine your goals to be clear, trackable, realistic, significant, and timely.": "SMART 原则从五个方面检查目标：具体、可衡量、可实现、相关、有时限。\n\n逐项填写，明确要做什么、怎样衡量成果，以及何时完成。",
